        result1->undefined
        result1->undefined
     3.EXECUTION PHASE
        val1<-10
        val2<-5
        addNum->new execution context (a new sand box will be created)->(new variable environment+ execution thread)
        1. memory phase val1->undefined
                        val2->undefined
                        total->undefined
        2.execution phase num1->10
                          num2->5
                          total->15(will return to global exection context) 
                          result=15               
